msgid "This series is recommended for newer hardware."
msgstr "Deze reeks wordt aangeraden voor zeer nieuwe apparatuur."

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintsysadm/page_kernels.py:1165
msgid ""
"This series sometimes provides newer kernels than the HWE series but without "
